        "original_id": "70f2abb7-ec53-5af2-b02a-6e1636db6a53",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Midnight Oil, Switchfoot\n- People: Peter Garrett, Jon Foreman, Tim Foreman, Chad Butler, Jerome Fontamillas, Drew Shirley\n- Places: Sydney, San Diego, California\n- Topics: band renaming, band membership\n\nFacts:\n- By late 1976, Peter Garrett moved to Sydney to complete his law degree.\n- By late 1976, Farm changed its name to Midnight Oil by drawing the name out of a hat.\n- Switchfoot is an American alternative rock band from San Diego, California.\n- Jon Foreman is Switchfoot's lead vocalist and guitarist.\n- Tim Foreman is Switchfoot's bass guitarist and backing vocalist.\n- Chad Butler is Switchfoot's drummer and percussionist.\n- Jerome Fontamillas is Switchfoot's guitarist, keyboardist, and backing vocalist.\n- Drew Shirley is Switchfoot's guitarist and backing vocalist.",
